'''Silent Night''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 15th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade appears to have a gradient from a baby blue to a solid black, resembling the night sky. It also has some stars imprinted on it, one being rather large, representing the holy star seen in a silent night, hence the name. Similarly to the blade, the guard is also baby blue, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Silent Night (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

